- Initial load: <2 seconds
- Navigation: <500ms
- Form submission: <1 second
- Data fetch: <1 second

**Optimizations:**

- Image lazy loading
- Code splitting by route
- Database query optimization
- Caching (Redis)
- CDN for static assets

## 5.2 Responsive Design

**Breakpoints:**

```
Mobile:  <768px
Tablet:  768-1023px
Desktop: 1024-1279px
Large:   ≥1280px
```

**Mobile Adaptations:**

- Sidebar becomes drawer
- Tables become cards
- Multi-column layouts stack
- Touch-friendly targets (44px min)
- Reduced form complexity

## 5.3 Accessibility

**Requirements:**

- WCAG 2.1 Level AA
- Keyboard navigation
- Screen reader support
- Color contrast ≥4.5:1
- Focus indicators
- Alt text for images
- ARIA labels

## 5.4 Browser Support

**Minimum:**

- Chrome 90+
- Firefox 88+
- Safari 14+
- Edge 90+

**Not Supported:**

- IE11 and below

## 5.5 Data Security

**Requirements:**

- HTTPS only
- Password hashing (bcrypt)
- SQL injection prevention
- XSS protection
- CSRF tokens
- Rate limiting
- Session management
- Regular security audits

## 5.6 Data Backup

**Strategy:**

- Automated daily backups
- Off-site storage
- 30-day retention
- Point-in-time recovery
- Backup testing monthly

## 5.7 Error Handling

**User-Facing:**

- Clear error messages
- Helpful suggestions
- No technical jargon
- Toast notifications
- Form validation

**Logging:**

- Error tracking (Sentry/similar)
- User actions logged
- System events logged
- Log rotation
- Alert on critical errors

## 5.8 Testing Requirements

**Unit Tests:**

- All business logic
- Utility functions
- 80% code coverage

**Integration Tests:**

- API endpoints
- Database operations
- External integrations

**E2E Tests:**

- Critical user paths
- Complete workflows
- Cross-browser testing

**Manual Testing:**

- UI/UX review
- Accessibility audit
- Performance testing
- Security testing

